# ÉLITE Dental Clinic & Atelier - Environment Configuration Guide

This file outlines all environment variables required for running ÉLITE Dental Clinic in development and production environments.

## Required Public Environment Variables

```env
# Supabase Live Project Endpoint URL
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://yftudklziamoxyjeeytd.supabase.co

# Supabase Public Anonymous API Key (Safe for Browser & Client-side code)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_iYWpzhB7AdCfWF_ysA83GA_Afp-p2C9
```

## Optional / Future Integration Variables

```env
# Supabase Private Service Role Key (SERVER ONLY - NEVER expose to browser)
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_private_service_role_key_here

# Resend Email Integration API Key (SERVER ONLY)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_123456789_your_key_here

# Production Site URL
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
```

## Security Best Practices
- **Client Safety**: Only variables prefixed with `NEXT_PUBLIC_` will be exposed to the browser.
- **Server Privacy**: Keep service keys (`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`, `RESEND_API_KEY`) strictly in private `.env.local` files on host servers.
